{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 29,
  "name": {
    "ja": "ミミックの財宝",
    "en": "The Mimic's Treasure",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 25,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "ブラックマーケットの店主が新しい盗賊ギルドを開業しようとしているらしい。",
          "俺には競争相手は要らない。ここにブラックマーケットの裏の宝物庫の鍵がある。",
          "お前がその中の全ての物を壊してくれば褒美をやる。",
          "場所はブラックマーケットの裏だ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The Black Market's owner is thinking of opening another Thieves Guild. ",
          "I do not need the competition, here is the key to the Black Market's",
          "treasure room.  Destroy everything you find there and you will",
          "be rewarded.  The quest is located in the Black Market building.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["よくやった。報酬は外に置いてある。"],
        "en": ["You have done well, your reward is outside the door.  "],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "このクエストには失敗したようだが、見つけたアイテムはお前のものだ。",
          "次のクエストに進め。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "You have failed this quest, but keep what you have found.  ",
          "Proceed to the next quest.",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
